.TH BC250\-BIOS\-COMPARE 1 "2026-08-30" "bc250-bios-compare 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bc250\-bios\-compare \- read and compare the menus of AMD BC\-250 BIOS images
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bc250\-bios\-compare
.RI [ IMAGE.rom ]
.RB [ \-\-bios ]
.br
.B bc250\-bios\-compare
.B \-\-help
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the window: the tree of menus on the left, the selected entry and the
effect of a change on the right.
.PP
It shows
.B all
the entries of a BIOS image, including the ones the firmware hides \- 651 of
them in a stock BC\-250 image \- which a running board cannot show by
definition. The firmware's own conditions are then evaluated against a state
of the variables, so changing an entry shows what appears and what disappears.
.PP
It does not boot the firmware and it writes nothing to any hardware. Every
image is opened read\-only.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I IMAGE.rom
The image to open at start. Without it the program comes up empty and the
image is chosen from the File menu.
.TP
.B \-\-bios
Land straight on the BIOS view, the screen drawn with the glyphs and the
palette taken out of the image, walked with the same keys as the board:
arrows to move, Enter into a submenu, Esc back, plus and minus through the
values, F9 for the defaults.
.TP
.B \-h ", " \-\-help
Print this summary and exit.
.SH LANGUAGES
The interface starts in English and offers nine languages \- en, it, es, pt,
fr, de, pl, uk, ru \- from the drop\-down at the top right. The choice is
remembered in
.IR ~/.config/bc250\-bios\-compare.json .
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DISPLAY
A window needs one. With no display the program says so and stops, rather
than failing with a Tcl error; over ssh use
.BR bc250\-bios\-compare\-cli (1)
instead.
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Where the settings file goes, if set.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/bc250\-bios\-compare/
The program, its translations and the parameter cards.
.TP
.I ~/.config/bc250\-bios\-compare.json
The chosen language.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bc250\-bios\-compare\-cli (1)
.PP
The full description is at
.UR https://github.com/MTSistemi/bc250\-bios\-compare
.UE .
.SH AUTHOR
MTSistemi.
